    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>On the Promenade du Cap-Martin, between Menton and Monaco, Madame BLEUE serves Mediterranean cuisine with a sea view, in a relaxed atmosphere. Very well rated: 4.5/5 on Tripadvisor, 12th restaurant out of 64 in Roquebrune-Cap-Martin.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The specialised directory BringFido reports a particularly thoughtful welcome for dogs, with a water bowl offered on arrival and a team "known for its kindness towards dogs." A detailed customer review on TripAdvisor confirms an evening dinner with a dog, with a good welcome and a lovely view — a second review also confirms a good welcome for a dog in the evening. Closed all day Tuesday and Sunday evening; exact prices are not published, but reviews describe them as "rather high but justified."</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: book towards the end of the day to enjoy the sunset over Cap-Martin.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Cap-Martin coastal trail, just below, makes for a lovely walk with your dog before or after the meal.</p>
